Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["TensorCalc", "ObjectName",
 CellID->576244419,ExpressionUUID->"d1627dbb-c2d1-4f4e-b239-37b7ae99a4a3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"8deb7ec4-4ee4-304d-a0f4-d4c2d82bc21b"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["TensorCalc",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsTensorTools/ref/TensorCalc"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["data", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["gradients", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["bvalue", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "948aa35a-46e9-e147-aed7-441403d6b73c"],
 "\[LineSeparator]calculates the diffusion tensor for the given dataset. \
Allows for one unweighted image and one b value. Gradient directions must be \
in the form {{x1,y1,z1}, ..., {xn,yn,zn}} without the unweighted gradient \
direction. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["bvalue", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "f6c7a8df-4321-2d49-80c2-8cf339bc9ee3"],
 " is a singe number indicating the b-value used. \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"c82e0892-685a-b64e-acd5-fb770d8b4b51"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["TensorCalc",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsTensorTools/ref/TensorCalc"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["data", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["gradients", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["bvec", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "59bfa000-74f5-654e-ae78-a918f5bc1b70"],
 "\[LineSeparator]calculates the diffusion tensor for the given dataset. \
allows for multiple unweighted images and multiple bvalues. allows for \
different tensor fitting methods. gradient directions must be in the form \
{{x1,y1,z1}, ..., {xn,yn,zn}} with the unweighted direction as {0,0,0}. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["bvec", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a1974329-60f4-e44b-8945-8dcc823d19fc"],
 " the b-vector, with a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["bvalue", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "325fb672-ba03-bb43-bee3-a7dda947587f"],
 " defined for each gradient direction. b value for unweighted images is 0. \n\
",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"3b21bf33-bf43-2549-9a56-ea97885400a1"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["TensorCalc",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsTensorTools/ref/TensorCalc"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["data", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["bmatrix", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9aec15f9-8827-f643-903f-f4d70842a78d"],
 "\[LineSeparator]calculates the diffusion tensor for the given dataset. \
allows for multiple unweighted images and multiple bvalues. bmat is the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["bmatrix", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "e4cb4f95-bb7e-1c4e-b32e-2521cfdd8272"],
 " which can be generated using ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["Bmatrix",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/Bmatrix"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"85fea06d-4fb8-7b4e-b8aa-d9b30f065a30"],
 ". The bvalue assumed to be is in s/mm^2 and therefore the output is in \
mm^2/2. \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"c9d2bb56-019e-6147-ba48-66050c64de5d"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["TensorCalc",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsTensorTools/ref/TensorCalc"], "[", "]"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"59630eb4-d3d3-dd4b-b24c-dc430d9890c7"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is based on DOI: 10.1016/j.neuroimage.2013.05.028 and \
10.1002/mrm.25165."
}], "Usage",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9966567166003017`*^9, 3.996656717032793*^9}},
 CellID->418623706,ExpressionUUID->"5fc50a6a-d223-3c43-b80d-ebdfbadbe056"],

